  "name": "Reap's ranks come back from Redshade's Bloodshatter silently (#12596)",
  "contract": [
    "A level 60 Reaper knows Reap ranks 1 to 8 (500357 to 573303) as separate active spells, and Redshade's",
    "Bloodshatter (Dummy) 525299 swaps every rank for Bloodshatter 505326. Undoing a swap that other ranks",
    "still share took the previousShared branch of Player::SetTemporarySpellReplacement, which sent a plain",
    "SMSG_LEARNED_SPELL, so the client printed 'You have learned a new ability: Reap (Rank N)' for every",
    "rank but the last, as reported in game on 2026-11-18. That learn packet is now sent between the hidden",
    "and restored notice rows the removal branch already uses. Expected: every rank is Reap again and no",
    "rank or Bloodshatter prints a chat line. reaper-redshade-client-swap-12596 covers the single-rank swap."
  ],
